<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mustek cautions it in talks.</title>
<headline>Mustek cautions it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mustek Ltd said on Tuesday it was in talks which if successful could impact on its shareprice.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
